 <section class="hmn-ea-step" data-step="3"><h3>بازبینی و ثبت نهایی</h3><div class="hmn-ea-summary"></div><div class="hmn-ea-actions"><button class="hmn-ea-back" type="button">بازگشت</button><button class="hmn-ea-submit" type="submit">ثبت نوبت</button></div></section><p class="hmn-ea-message" aria-live="polite"></p>
